		(property "Description" "AMPAK AP6276P 2T2R Wi-Fi 6E (PCIe) + BT5.4 (UART/PCM), 15x13mm 55-pad stamp LGA. Official Rev 1.1 WEB: VBAT 3.3-4.8V, VDDIO 1.68-1.98V. Tri-variant fit: AP6275P/AP6275PR3 use pads 1-50 at 3.3V; pads 17/18 are NC on AP6275P(R3) and GPIO on AP6276P; pad 48 is BT_ANT (BT RF port) on AP6275PR3/AP6276PR3 and NC-floating on plain AP6275P/AP6276P."
